    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOTI TD</strong> puts you in charge of a single tower fighting off endless waves of zombies and mobs from all around. Can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/a81a3b73e8b5d28acce313f57191df6d.poster.avif?t=1748387063\" width=738 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/a81a3b73e8b5d28acce313f57191df6d.webm?t=1748387063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/a81a3b73e8b5d28acce313f57191df6d.mp4?t=1748387063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Deck</strong><br>Craft your perfect deck of cards, choosing from powerful elemental attacks and strategic abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Abilities &amp; Upgrades</strong><br>Unlock abilities and upgrade your tower to stand strong against the growing horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Cards</strong><br>Play your cards at the right time and in the right order. Timing and combos are everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/c1d6b3c268e5e91f37b4027a613f4513.poster.avif?t=1748387063\" width=598 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/c1d6b3c268e5e91f37b4027a613f4513.webm?t=1748387063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/c1d6b3c268e5e91f37b4027a613f4513.mp4?t=1748387063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOTI TD</strong> puts you in charge of a single tower fighting off endless waves of zombies and mobs from all around. Can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/a81a3b73e8b5d28acce313f57191df6d.poster.avif?t=1748387063\" width=738 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/a81a3b73e8b5d28acce313f57191df6d.webm?t=1748387063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/a81a3b73e8b5d28acce313f57191df6d.mp4?t=1748387063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Deck</strong><br>Craft your perfect deck of cards, choosing from powerful elemental attacks and strategic abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Abilities &amp; Upgrades</strong><br>Unlock abilities and upgrade your tower to stand strong against the growing horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Cards</strong><br>Play your cards at the right time and in the right order. Timing and combos are everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/c1d6b3c268e5e91f37b4027a613f4513.poster.avif?t=1748387063\" width=598 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/c1d6b3c268e5e91f37b4027a613f4513.webm?t=1748387063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739680/extras/c1d6b3c268e5e91f37b4027a613f4513.mp4?t=1748387063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
